---
// Hero.astro - Full 100vh viewport hero with left-side narrative only and unobstructed wide-angle solar engineer on right
---

<section class="relative min-h-[100dvh] w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#0F2540] text-white flex items-center py-20 lg:py-0">
  
  <!-- Broad Full-Screen Background Image: Engineer on Right with Rooftop Solar Panels -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden">
    <img
      id="hero-bg-img"
      src="/hero-solar-engineer.jpg"
      alt="Wave Power Solar lead engineer standing beside rooftop solar panels at golden sunset"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-[78%_center] sm:object-[80%_center] md:object-[82%_center] lg:object-right-center filter brightness-[0.98] contrast-[1.02] transition-transform duration-100 ease-out will-change-transform"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
    <!-- Directional Cinematic Gradient: High contrast scrim on mobile so text is razor-sharp, clear view of engineer on right -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0F2540]/95 via-[#0F2540]/80 md:via-[#0F2540]/45 to-[#0F2540]/40 lg:to-transparent"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0F2540]/80 via-transparent to-[#0F2540]/95"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero Content: LEFT SIDE ONLY -->
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 w-full pt-12 sm:pt-20 lg:pt-0">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Exclusively typography, value highlights, and action buttons -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 xl:col-span-6 space-y-5 sm:space-y-6">
        
        <!-- Location & Authorization Badge with gentle levitation -->
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0F2540]/85 border border-white/20 text-xs sm:text-sm text-white backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg card-glow animate-float max-w-full">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 sm:w-2.5 sm:h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#EA6B1F] animate-pulse shrink-0"></span>
          <span class="font-medium truncate">Varanasi's Leading Solar Partner</span>
          <span class="text-white/40 hidden xs:inline">•</span>
          <span class="text-[#F98A3D] font-semibold hidden xs:inline">PM Surya Ghar</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Headline -->
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-serif font-medium leading-[1.18] sm:leading-[1.12] tracking-tight text-white drop-shadow-md">
          Stop paying for electricity when the sun shines on your roof <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#EA6B1F] via-[#F98A3D] to-amber-200 italic">every single day.</span>
        </h1>

        <!-- Narrative Lead Copy -->
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg text-white/90 leading-relaxed max-w-xl font-light drop-shadow">
          Your power bill climbs higher every summer across Varanasi, Mirzapur, and Prayagraj. Generate your own clean power, claim up to <strong class="font-semibold text-white underline decoration-[#EA6B1F] decoration-2 underline-offset-4">₹78,000 direct PM Surya Ghar subsidy</strong>, and bring your electricity bills close to zero.
        </p>

        <!-- 3 Clean Trust Value Highlights with 21st.dev 3D Tilt, Spotlight & Mobile Touch Feedback -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 sm:gap-4 max-w-lg pt-1">
          <div class="p-2 sm:p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#0F2540]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/15 shadow-md card-glow spotlight-card tilt-card touch-press cursor-default text-center sm:text-left card-ambient-pulse">
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#EA6B1F]">₹0</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-white/80 mt-0.5 leading-tight">Target bill</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2 sm:p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#0F2540]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/15 shadow-md card-glow spotlight-card tilt-card touch-press cursor-default text-center sm:text-left card-ambient-pulse">
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white">₹78,000</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-white/80 mt-0.5 leading-tight">Bank subsidy</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2 sm:p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#0F2540]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/15 shadow-md card-glow spotlight-card tilt-card touch-press cursor-default text-center sm:text-left card-ambient-pulse">
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#3E7CC9]">25 Yrs</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-white/80 mt-0.5 leading-tight">Warranty</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Action CTAs: Responsive Stack on Mobile with continuous shimmer -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 pt-2">
          <a
            href="#calculator"
            class="btn-shimmer btn-shimmer-continuous touch-press inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-white bg-[#EA6B1F] hover:bg-[#F98A3D] shadow-lg shadow-[#EA6B1F]/30 transition-all duration-200 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-95 gap-2 w-full sm:w-auto"
          >
            <span>Calculate Your Savings</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 animate-bounce" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          
          <a
            href="tel:+919415012345"
            class="touch-press inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-white/90 hover:text-white bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 border border-white/15 backdrop-blur-md transition-all active:scale-95 w-full sm:w-auto"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#EA6B1F]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>+91 94150 12345</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Social Proof snippet -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-1">
          <div class="flex -space-x-2 overflow-hidden">
            <img class="inline-block h-8 w-8 rounded-full ring-2 ring-[#0F2540] object-cover" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=120&q=80" alt="Customer avatar" />
            <img class="inline-block h-8 w-8 rounded-full ring-2 ring-[#0F2540] object-cover" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=120&q=80" alt="Customer avatar" />
            <img class="inline-block h-8 w-8 rounded-full ring-2 ring-[#0F2540] object-cover" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=120&q=80" alt="Customer avatar" />
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs text-white/90 font-medium">
            <strong class="text-[#F98A3D]">★★★★★ 4.8/5</strong> from 5,000+ happy roofs in Varanasi, Mirzapur & Prayagraj
          </span>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Completely open to showcase the broad background image and the engineer -->
      <div class="hidden lg:block lg:col-span-5 xl:col-span-6 h-full"></div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Bottom Scroll Down Indicator -->
  <a
    href="#calculator"
    class="absolute bottom-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors group cursor-pointer"
    aria-label="Scroll down to quotation calculator"
  >
    <span class="tracking-wider uppercase font-medium text-[10px]">Scroll to Calculate Savings</span>
    <div class="w-6 h-9 rounded-full border-2 border-white/30 flex justify-center p-1 group-hover:border-[#EA6B1F] transition-colors">
      <div class="w-1.5 h-2.5 bg-[#EA6B1F] rounded-full animate-bounce"></div>
    </div>
  </a>

</section>
